{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_039_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ea9eb1905b2d7aca90faa4c6e228fd99d94a39130be6b794c9f2071995c59076",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b86ed9e1aed6f01ea6ea543ab3fd439210e26f972c46012bd9259d29c597e1a",
      "text": "哦哦，这盒巧克力是给我的吗！\n非常感谢，●●●●●●●●●●师父！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42441d82cc112e7f62b4a22badad0008731457c29e1f3ab12002eeea5edd815b",
      "text": "哎呀——我都完全忘记\n今天是情人节了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9857c860c61d2fb34c175023434eae22587ddb3ce5573a8749a45e51cb4f3dd5",
      "text": "成为偶像之后，\n感觉岁月流逝得真快啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0a82b82747681635ffebf9e10c5292521568f31bcf9c638d7350a01589f2de",
      "text": "啊，抱歉，把话题扯远了。\n这盒巧克力我心怀感激地收下了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:052a77959c275945f46b397758c8ed01a5de654ecbf81463fb1784c3f184edf7",
      "text": "白色情人节的回礼还请好好期待一下哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53ce6a237c0374663c9026dfd0a93e9ffc9b6f59a2c469168792a78df533fe3c",
      "text": "谢谢你的情人节巧克力！\n●●●●●●●●●●师父！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d46a3dc98bf53bcc2111eebda95005491cd92672e4b0550b0cab6422dbbd020a",
      "text": "能收到师父送的巧克力，真开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2172f5162e86b911e07d483132d88785b75e18f0482783eae68c80454d027eb6",
      "text": "早知如此，\n我也该事先准备一份才对呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f3117508d722b05d8e1ee2c81b903786c8e578139126e60b6a20f998c90cb3c",
      "text": "我也很想让●●●●●●●●●●师父\n开心一下啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:228a947e95b4d88ae24a8d887f8b6ca640cada17398a83cbb2b9877587c61853",
      "text": "这份心意，白色情人节时我一定会努力加倍奉还的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20b661bccc07bc3272c82134af184a8b93d703fcc4192e306ac143a34c442e2c",
      "text": "为了能让你高兴，我会准备好最棒的礼物的！\n敬请期待吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_b:cmd-000041:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a386eb374f663d888b84b860f25d9b6bb5ade841c9197725eb4b86db60d95ac8",
      "text": "我很期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_b:cmd-000042:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7179eb5c8a1581ea47a2de88ca7d9ad39f5a60a64c656e63cc3c074579ad2c52",
      "text": "敬请期待呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2af53ac8e674e78a0f28dcf524f607a52c63bac246df8a5d8a3d39398601fab9",
      "text": "哈哈，我是不是把门槛抬得太高了？\n不过我一定会超越这份期待给你看的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_039_22:5_01_039_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5de7afc63ae15bd1589533d88a393f9c39e3ff11b7c67afc498c5e80b0ce00c7",
      "text": "巧克力我稍后会好好享用的！\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
